  "guidebook": {
    "intro": "Kusimulia hadithi kando ya moto, **okugera enfumo**, kumebeba hekima ya Waganda kwa vizazi. Hadithi zina maneno yake ya kufungua, kuunganisha na kufunga, kama **Paukwa! Pakawa!** ya Kiswahili.",
    "phrases": [
      {
        "target": "Olwatuuka olwali olumu…",
        "base": "Hapo zamani za kale, siku moja…"
      },
      {
        "target": "Waaliwo omusajja omu.",
        "base": "Palikuwa na mwanamume."
      },
      {
        "target": "Awo n’agenda mu kibira.",
        "base": "Kisha akaenda msituni."
      },
      {
        "target": "N’alaba empologoma!",
        "base": "Akaona simba!"
      },
      {
        "target": "Ekyavaamu, n’addayo awaka.",
        "base": "Mwishowe, akarudi nyumbani."
      },
      {
        "target": "Enfumo yange ekomye awo.",
        "base": "Hadithi yangu inaishia hapo."
      }
    ],
    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "story-openings",
        "title": "Kufungua hadithi",
        "body": [
          "Anza na **Olwatuuka** (ilitokea) au **Olwatuuka olwali olumu** (ilitokea siku moja), kisha eleza mandhari kwa **Waaliwo** (palikuwa na): **Waaliwo omusajja omu** (palikuwa na mwanamume mmoja). **Waaliwo** ni kama Kiswahili **palikuwa**, kwa ngeli ya mahali."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "narrative-ne",
        "title": "Kisha: ne-",
        "body": [
          "Katika hadithi, kila tukio jipya ni kitenzi chenye **ne-** mbele: **n’agenda** (akaenda), **n’alaba** (akaona), **n’agamba** (akasema). Hufanya kazi kama **-ka-** ya Kiswahili, ikiunganisha matukio moja baada ya jingine.",
          "Tumia **Awo** (kisha, basi) kusogeza hadithi mbele, na **Ekyavaamu** (mwishowe) kuimaliza."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Hadithi za usiku",
        "body": [
          "Hadithi zilisimuliwa jioni baada ya chakula cha usiku, mara nyingi na babu na bibi. Nyingi zinamhusu **Wakayima** sungura, mjanja mwenye hila, kama Sungura wa hadithi za Kiswahili. Utakutana naye katika Kipengele 40."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "amaras-story",
      "title": "Amara anasimulia hadithi",
      "unlockAfter": "u35s3l3",
      "cast": [
        "amara",
        "emma"
      ],
      "summary": "Amara anamsimulia Emma hadithi kuhusu mvulana na simba.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Amara, ngerera enfumo!",
            "base": "Amara, nisimulie hadithi!"
          },
          "gloss": {
            "ngerera": "nisimulie"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Kale nno. Olwatuuka olwali olumu, waaliwo omulenzi omu.",
            "base": "Basi. Hapo zamani za kale, palikuwa na mvulana."
          },
          "gloss": {
            "omulenzi": "mvulana"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Awo n’agenda mu kibira okunoonya enku.",
            "base": "Kisha akaenda msituni kutafuta kuni."
          },
          "gloss": {
            "okunoonya": "kutafuta",
            "enku": "kuni"
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Kwa nini mvulana alienda msituni?",
          "options": [
            "Kutafuta kuni",
            "Kuwinda",
            "Kucheza mpira"
          ],
          "answer": 0
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "N’alaba ki?",
            "base": "Na akaona nini?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "N’alaba empologoma nnene nnyo!",
            "base": "Akaona simba mkubwa sana!"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Ayi! N’adduka?",
            "base": "Lo! Alikimbia?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Nedda. N’atuula wansi, n’ayimba oluyimba.",
            "base": "Hapana. Akaketi chini akaimba wimbo."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Mvulana alifanya nini alipomwona simba?",
          "options": [
            "Alikimbia",
            "Aliketi akaimba wimbo",
            "Alipanda mti"
          ],
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Empologoma n’ewuliriza, n’ewummula, n’egenda.",
            "base": "Simba akasikiliza, akapumzika, akaondoka."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "amara",
            "target": "Ekyavaamu, omulenzi n’addayo awaka n’enku. Enfumo yange ekomye awo.",
            "base": "Mwishowe, mvulana akarudi nyumbani na kuni. Hadithi yangu inaishia hapo."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Amara anamalizaje hadithi?",
          "options": [
            "Enfumo yange ekomye awo.",
            "Olwatuuka olwali olumu.",
            "Waaliwo omusajja."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
